    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48102" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέμεθλα</span></b> , τά, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίθημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>foundations, lowest part</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμοῖο θ</span>. <i>roots</i> of the eye, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.493
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στομάχοιο θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				17.47
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὠκεανοῖο θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				816
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄμμωνος θ</span>. <i>the place
