				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παγγαίου θ</span>. <i>the
			roots</i> of Mt. Pangaeus, ib.<i><span class="en">
				180
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. δίκης</span>”
