					Sol.
					4.14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ θεμέθλων</span>, Lat.
				<i>funditus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simm.
				25.4
			</span></i>: dub. in sg., <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				248
			</span></i> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέμειλον</span>).</div>
